{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y 的大字句子明显偏长，尤其 S04、S07、S11、S13，扫读时不如 X 利落，容易让观众来不及抓住重点。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 把人物每一步情绪变化背后的原因、顾虑和心理转折放进了大字，即使完全没读过原文，也能明白他为什么从试探、放松、期待走向不安，最后接受无法保证永远。尤其 S08—S14，期待、害怕、暂时放下、决定继续付出、再次害怕失去、最终不再强求，形成了清楚而细腻的心理链条；X 虽然更利于扫读，也保留了不少有韵味的短词，但部分关键动机和转折需要观众自行补全。总体而言，Y 的理解完整度和情感层次明显胜出，代价是牺牲了一些屏幕上的轻盈感。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b19071f9-c884-4f7f-9e89-335325ce4d56", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T193634811444Z", "elapsed_seconds": 54.812, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T19:37:29.636968+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a8f91681d011eb4765f3d32689ac96a6064f662db8fc0515169fe8aa218e727c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3